OL,3,AKing's Caribbean tour will not shy away
OL,4,Afrom 'darkest days of our past'
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles's upcoming Caribbean tour
OL,7,Fwill not shy away from "the darkest
OL,8,Fdays of our past", Buckingham Palace
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FDuring the visits, the King is expected
OL,12,Fto face renewed calls to apologise for
OL,13,Fthe UK's role in the transatlantic
OL,14,Fslave trade and be questioned on
OL,15,Fpotential reparations - compensation
OL,16,Ffrom countries that took part in the
OL,17,Fslave trade.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
