OL,3,AKing's Caribbean tour will not shy away
OL,4,Afrom 'darkest days of our past'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe King and Queen Camilla are set to
OL,7,Ftravel to Antigua and Barbuda for the
OL,8,FCommonwealth Heads of Government
OL,9,Fmeeting, with visits also to Bahamas
OL,10,Fand Guyana as part of the eight-day
OL,11,Ftrip starting on October 27.
OL,13,FAccording to PA news agency, it is
OL,14,Funderstood the government has not
OL,15,Fadvised the King to apologise or offer
OL,16,Freparations.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
